## UsageApi

### Get audio speeches usage details for the organization.
## Get audio speeches usage details for the organization.
GET https://api.openai.com/v1/organization/usage/audio_speeches?startTime={{startTime}}&endTime={{endTime}}&bucketWidth={{bucketWidth}}&projectIds={{projectIds}}&userIds={{userIds}}&apiKeyIds={{apiKeyIds}}&models={{models}}&groupBy={{groupBy}}&limit={{limit}}&page={{page}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

